     2	
     3	## Papers Analyzed
     4	
     5	1. **Autonomous Agents for Scientific Discovery (Zhou et al., 2025)** — Comprehensive survey
     6	2. **Coscientist (Boiko et al., 2023)** — Emergent autonomous scientific research
     7	3. **Deep Lead Optimization (JACS 2024, Zhang et al.)** — Generative AI for structural modification
