    10	| Strategy | mutate, docking_guidance=on |
    11	
    12	## Molecular Analysis
    13	
    14	Top 10 molecules:
    15	1. Diaryl benzophenone (BE=-10.119) — Suzuki + Friedel-Crafts, 2-step
    16	2. Imino-biaryl benzophenone (BE=-9.762) — Imine + Suzuki
    17	3. Amino-biaryl benzophenone (BE=-9.725) — Suzuki + F-C
    18	4. Styrenyl biaryl (BE=-9.704) — Wittig + Suzuki
    19	5. Biaryl benzophenone (BE=-9.537) — F-C + Suzuki
    20	6. Amino-biaryl benzophenone (BE=-9.509) — F-C + Suzuki
    21	7. Aminopyridine-biaryl (BE=-9.351) — Suzuki + F-C
    22	8. Sulfonamide-biaryl (BE=-9.085) — Amide + Suzuki
    23	9. Thienyl-biaryl (BE=-9.027) — F-C + Suzuki
    24	10. Benzoxazole-phenyl (BE=-8.354) — Halogenation + Suzuki
    25	
    26	## Bottleneck Identified: Scaffold Homogeneity
    27	
    28	**Observation**: 9/10 molecules are benzophenone/biaryl chemotypes. Despite the SCAFFOLDS library containing 90+ entries including kinase-specific heterocycles (purines, pyrazolopyrimidines, azaindoles, imidazopyridines), none appeared in the top results.
    29	
    30	**Root Cause**: `random.choice(seeds)` in `generate_molecules()` treats all scaffolds uniformly. With 90+ scaffolds, kinase-privileged entries (~8 entries: purine, azaindole, pyrazolopyrimidine, imidazopyridine, pyrazolopyrimidine, indolizine, quinazoline, benzimidazole) each have only ~1% selection probability per seed. The benzophenone/biaryl scaffolds produce better initial docking scores, so they dominate the evolutionary process.
    31	
    32	**Impact**: 
    33	- Limited chemical diversity in output
    34	- Misses TYK2 hinge-binding pharmacophore (NH...O=C hydrogen bonds with hinge residues Glu979/Met981)
    35	- All molecules bind through similar interactions (mostly hydrophobic + polar contacts in the DFG-out pocket)
    36	
    37	---
    38	
    39	## Proposed Hypothesis: H021
    40	
    41	```
    42	假设ID: H021
    43	瓶颈: 分子骨架同质化——90%+输出为二苯甲酮/联芳基类型，激酶铰链结合杂环骨架完全缺失
    44	文献支撑: 
    45	  - Deep Lead Optimization (JACS 2024, §3.1 Scaffold Hopping): 
    46	    "替换核心骨架同时保留有利取代基"是先导化合物优化的核心子任务
    47	  - MOOSE-Chem (Yang et al., 2025): 
    48	    "Diverse initial population is essential for evolutionary search to avoid premature convergence"
    49	  - Coscientist (Boiko et al., 2023):
    50	    正确的化学空间导航需要靶点知识指导骨架选择
